\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {9}{\ignorespaces External baseline comparison on the coastal joint-assault scenario. All runs use seed 7 and 30 Monte Carlo simulation runs. Baseline results are from a single pipeline execution each; Pure and Full are from the 10-iteration ablation for reference. The Full row uses optimized HOPE parameters ($\theta =0.9$, $\epsilon =0.005$).}}{28}{}\protected@file@percent }
